            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ERP"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I don't have much time in the morning &amp; I prefer a breakfast that can be made faster than this one but it was good! The recipe for 1 made three pancakes but no where in the recipe did it indicate that! None of the \"similar\" recipes are gluten-free so they are not really similar.",
